sequenceDiagram
    participant KR as Kafka Real-Time Router
    participant NS as Node Server (SSE)
    participant AL as Apollo Link (React)
    participant AC as Apollo In-Memory Cache
    participant DOM as React DOM

    KR->>NS: Targeted Redis PUBLISH instance:Server-2
    NS->>AL: SSE Push: {__typename: Task, id: task-123, status: DONE}

    Note over AL: Apollo SSE Link intercepts payload
    AL->>AC: cache.modify({id: 'Task:task-123', fields: {status: () => 'DONE'}})

    Note over AC: Normalized cache entry updated in O(1)\nNo network request made to server
    AC->>DOM: React detects specific cache node change
    DOM->>DOM: Granular re-render of <TaskCard id=task-123> only

    Note over DOM: All other components remain untouched.\nNo page reload. No full data refetch.\nDatabase receives 0 additional queries.
